WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Service virtualization controls
a dependency so the team can repeat

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:06.480
selected conditions.
In this payment example,

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.000
the model can accept once, time
out or send a duplicate callback.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:15.280
A separate integration gate checks
agreed behavior against the real provider

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:20.241
and settlement process. Contract changes
trigger review of the substitute.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.520
A passing model proves only
the behavior it represents.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.080
Assign owners for fidelity,

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:29.760
state reset and refresh before
relying on it for the pilot.
